{"defaultLocale":"en-US","id":"NextTrace.NextTrace.Core","installers":[{"architecture":"x86","commands":["ntrace"],"dependencies":[],"id":"x86-portable","installModes":["interactive","silent","silentWithProgress"],"priority":4,"sha256":"99d98c0d78fc1fc7f89c5a25da6d99a31208e465bdb2a305a4fca381f800fb29","successCodes":[],"type":"portable","upgradeBehavior":"install","url":"https://github.com/nxtrace/NTrace-core/releases/download/v1.7.6/nexttrace_windows_386.exe"},{"architecture":"x64","commands":["ntrace"],"dependencies":[],"id":"x64-portable","installModes":["interactive","silent","silentWithProgress"],"priority":4,"sha256":"799ffd16489a1dd600a98903492bd07e60c2329ead1e2382df73216b4879fa4f","successCodes":[],"type":"portable","upgradeBehavior":"install","url":"https://github.com/nxtrace/NTrace-core/releases/download/v1.7.6/nexttrace_windows_amd64.exe"},{"architecture":"arm64","commands":["ntrace"],"dependencies":[],"id":"arm64-portable","installModes":["interactive","silent","silentWithProgress"],"priority":4,"sha256":"b5d91246c53bd7dfa05359fd5d7df756a4a0d9e81b11a9e91bc153ab76bfdeb9","successCodes":[],"type":"portable","upgradeBehavior":"install","url":"https://github.com/nxtrace/NTrace-core/releases/download/v1.7.6/nexttrace_windows_arm64.exe"}],"licenseUrl":"https://github.com/nxtrace/NTrace-core/blob/HEAD/LICENSE","packageLocalizations":{"en-US":{"description":"NextTrace, an open source visual route tracking CLI tool","license":"GPL-3.0","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/nxtrace/NTrace-core/blob/HEAD/LICENSE","locale":"en-US","longDescription":"An open source visual routing tool that pursues light weight, developed using Golang.","name":"NextTrace","packageUrl":"https://github.com/nxtrace/NTrace-core","publisher":"NextTrace Community","publisherSupportUrl":"https://github.com/nxtrace/NTrace-core/issues","publisherUrl":"https://github.com/nxtrace","releaseNotes":"What's Changed\n- 修复 iTerm2 选字时 MTR TUI 旧画面堆叠的问题：实时与回放统一按行更新变化内容，避免连续刷新写入滚动历史，并改善窗口缩放、残行清理和 Unicode 显示 by @tsosunchia in nxtrace#257\n- 修复 MTR 探测错误直接写入 stderr 导致交互画面错乱的问题：错误统一显示在 TUI 标题区，暂停时也能更新；收到成功响应或重置统计后清除提示\n- 修复 Windows ARM64 默认 IPv6 探测报错：ICMP、TCP、UDP 在 Traffic Class 为零时跳过系统不支持的 socket 设置，解决 set IPv6 Traffic Class 0: not implemented on windows/arm64 by @KexyBiscuit in nxtrace#260\n- 升级至 Go 1.27.3，正式发布、CI 和性能脚本统一使用 Go 默认 JSON 后端，移除 GOEXPERIMENT=nojsonv2 固定配置；继续使用 encoding/json v1 API\n- 改进 CI 专项验收调度：按改动路径选择检查，手动运行或无法读取差异时执行完整验收，保留基础测试、race 和跨平台构建 by @tsosunchia in nxtrace#258\n- 更新依赖：go-runewidth v0.0.31、MCP Go SDK v1.8.0、quic-go v0.64.1、table v1.4.1、gjson v1.20.0、x/net v0.61.0 等\n额外的：\nMTR 实时与回放画面按终端宽高显示，窗口较小时可放大查看更多跳；保存报告和会话录制仍保留完整统计。\nWindows ARM64 的修复仅跳过零值 Traffic Class 设置，不代表支持非零 --tos；非零设置失败时仍会返回错误。\n源码构建需要 Go 1.27.3+。对齐正式发布时使用默认 JSON 后端，无需再设置 GOEXPERIMENT=nojsonv2；macOS 最低支持版本仍为 13.0。","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/nxtrace/NTrace-core/releases/tag/v1.7.6","tags":["api","as-path","asn-lookup","geoip","geolocation","ip-lookup","network-analysis","next-trace","nexttrace","traceroute","utility"]}},"publisherSupportUrl":"https://github.com/nxtrace/NTrace-core/issues","publisherUrl":"https://github.com/nxtrace","releaseDate":"2026-11-06","releaseDateSource":"commit","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/nxtrace/NTrace-core/releases/tag/v1.7.6","schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","upstream":{"commit":"95bc45d10b1022b1d01f9574266a1fdbe9a5cb2a","manifestVersion":"1.28.0","manifests":[{"path":"manifests/n/NextTrace/NextTrace/Core/1.7.6/NextTrace.NextTrace.Core.installer.yaml","sha256":"38c036f3a096cb523c654da945ac4b4f13b89bc9a36682b6512f705243ce6f8b"},{"path":"manifests/n/NextTrace/NextTrace/Core/1.7.6/NextTrace.NextTrace.Core.locale.en-US.yaml","sha256":"d18c8886b01eea54732205816b949e90679676484215b4c817b7b88d49fff14f"},{"path":"manifests/n/NextTrace/NextTrace/Core/1.7.6/NextTrace.NextTrace.Core.yaml","sha256":"3be54449588be09c306a97cb760c30e6186dd5ecab6590eae7287e2d5cca9f81"}],"repository":"microsoft/winget-pkgs"},"version":"1.7.6"}